### Local secrets (NEVER commit) ###
# Real Sarvam / IVR credentials live in config/application-local.properties.
# application.properties keeps only ${ENV_VAR:} placeholders so it stays safe to
# track; the local profile file holds the actual values.
#
# Note it lives in config/ and NOT in src/main/resources/ on purpose: anything
# under resources is copied to target/classes and would be baked into the
# packaged JAR / Docker image. config/ is a Spring Boot default config location
# that is never part of the build output. The resources path stays listed below
# so an accidental copy there is still ignored.
config/application-local.properties
application-local.properties
src/main/resources/application-local.properties


